  "text": "GES Masterclass Workshop 17 | 05 | 2025 A practical workshop exploring the properties of London construction clay and its potential applications in a ceramic practice. Led by ceramicist Sara Howard, participants will collaboratively develop a range of clay bodies, glazes, slips, and engobes. This hands-on workshop promises to be both informative and engaging. Date: Saturday 17th May Time: 1-5pm Maximum Participants: 16 Price: £150 What You’ll Learn: As part of our workshop, attendees have the unique opportunity to work with London construction clay collected from a 12–14m deep excavation at a construction site in Wimbledon.",
