ips, and engobes. This hands-on workshop promises to be both informative and engaging.</p><p> </p><p><b>Date: </b>Saturday 17th May<br><b>Time:</b> 1-5pm<br><b>Maximum Participants:</b>16<br><b>Price:</b> £150</p><p> </p><p><b>What You’ll Learn:</b><br>As part of our workshop, attendees have the unique opportunity to work with London construction clay collected from a 12–14m deep excavation at a construction site in Wimbledon.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>"
